{
    "title": "Radio FM",
    "description": "\ud83d\udcfb<b>Radio FM</b> (Radio for Mobile) is an app to play Internet <b>Radio stations</b> and <b>Podcast</b> for Free, trusted by 75 Million+ listeners, and featured by <b>\ud83c\udfc6 Google as an Editors' Choice radio app</b>.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf85 Christmas-themed radio station - Enjoy the Christmas atmosphere with Christmas music and Christmas carols\ud83c\udf84.\r\n\r\nRadio FM allows you to listen to radio and podcasts and enjoy a variety of genres like <i>classical, rock, pop, instrumental, hip-hop, gospel, songs, music, talks, news, comedy, shows, concerts and other variety of programs </i>available by various Internet Radio Broadcasters and Podcasters across the world. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Listen and download the popular podcast with 18+ categories and 100+ languages\r\nAccess over 180,000+ poscasts and 20 million+ episode\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b>\r\n\u2665 RadioFM is fully supported for Android Auto, Google Chromecast, Android TV/ Android watch/ wearable\r\n Radio FM is the only app in the Play store that's offering the true Radio Experience with best-tuned features for FREE \r\n\u2665 Add to Favorites (Favourite List) \r\n\u2665 Access to recent list nd top rado, padcast \r\n\u2665 \u23f3SLEEP TIMER (Auto OFF) \u2022 Listen your favorite radio and podcas while you go to bed - without worrying about exhausting your Mobile data \u2022 Set the Sleep timer in the Radio FM app and the app will do the rest for you. It will auto off the Radio at the time you set \r\n\u2665 \u23f0ALARM CLOCK (Auto ON) \u2022 Set an Alarm for your favorite Radio \u2022 It will wake you up at alarm time and tunein automatically to Radio, so that you never miss the next News bulletin or the Talk show or Music DJ or RJ Program that you love \r\n\u2665 Add Shortcut on your Mobile home screen for fast tunein to your Online Radio Station \r\n\u2665 Easy to use and simple radio interface \r\n\u2665 Enjoy and download popular podcasts\r\n\u2665 Enjoy your favorite Radios and Podcast without headphones. \r\n\u2665 Quick swap/ Navigation between Favourite List, Countries List, Recent lists \r\n\u2665 Modern design to display the stations listing \r\n\u2665 Full Radio player to display title information about currently tuned in station in full screen \r\n\u2665 Fast Notification control to stop/start radio stream from home screen \r\n\u2665 Fast access to Radio from \r\n\u2022 Countries list (Select country and touch the Radio Station) \r\n\u2022 Favourite List (Just select the Radio Station) \r\n\u2022 Recent List (Just open the recent list and choose the radio station) \u2022\r\n Accces podcasts by different Categories \r\n\u2022 Shortcut on your Mobile Home screen \r\n\u2022 Search the radio and Podcas and select to tunein \r\n\u2022 Option to automatically tunein whenever you open the app \r\n\u2665 Suggest a Station feature to tunein to your local or any other radio station from any city, state or country \r\n\u2665 Radio broadcasters keep adding their Radio Stations to Radio FM platform through http://appradiofm.com/broadcaster/broadcaster-login/ \r\nSo Tunein new radio channels every time you use our app. \r\n\u2022 We already have more than 50,000 Radio Stations worldwide \r\n- Radio Sei, 98.1 FM, 104.5 FM, Tele Stereo 92.7 FM, 105 network, RDS from Italy \r\n- Virtual DJ, WIXX, ElectricFM, 1.FM Country One, DEFJAY, MOVIN, WOGK, KJLH, WPOZ, KEXP, KCRW from USA \r\n- Europe 1 104.7 FM, NRJ, Skyrock 96.0 FM, Fun Radio, RMC, RTL2 from France - BBC, Capital XTRA from UK \r\n\r\nListen popular pocast like -Global news podcast, ted talks, talk shows, fox news,The Ryen Russillo Podcast,Wild Things, the joe rogan experience and many more.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Still you don't find what you are searching, use Suggest Feature. Our team will try to add every new broadcasters for you, so you don't miss your favorite.\r\n \r\nOUR USERS\r\n Radio FM is a trusted Radio App by 75 million user worldwide. We have a promise with our users to provide best playback quality and thrive to make it better everyday. \r\n\r\nCheck out the FAQs at http://appRadioFM.com/faq-list/ \r\n\r\nSTAY TUNED \r\nFacebook: http://fb.com/radiofmapp \r\nInstagram: http://instagram.com/radiofmapp \r\nTwitter: http://twitter.com/radiofmapp \r\nYoutube: www.youtube.com/Radio-fmIn \r\n\r\nWrite to us at support@appRadioFM.com \r\n\r\nKeep Listening \r\nRadio FM",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udcfb<b>Radio FM</b> (Radio for Mobile) is an app to play Internet <b>Radio stations</b> and <b>Podcast</b> for Free, trusted by 75 Million+ listeners, and featured by <b>\ud83c\udfc6 Google as an Editors&#39; Choice radio app</b>.<br><br>\ud83c\udf85 Christmas-themed radio station - Enjoy the Christmas atmosphere with Christmas music and Christmas carols\ud83c\udf84.<br><br>Radio FM allows you to listen to radio and podcasts and enjoy a variety of genres like <i>classical, rock, pop, instrumental, hip-hop, gospel, songs, music, talks, news, comedy, shows, concerts and other variety of programs </i>available by various Internet Radio Broadcasters and Podcasters across the world. <br><br>\ud83c\udfa7 Listen and download the popular podcast with 18+ categories and 100+ languages<br>Access over 180,000+ poscasts and 20 million+ episode<br><br><b>Features</b><br>\u2665 RadioFM is fully supported for Android Auto, Google Chromecast, Android TV/ Android watch/ wearable<br> Radio FM is the only app in the Play store that&#39;s offering the true Radio Experience with best-tuned features for FREE <br>\u2665 Add to Favorites (Favourite List) <br>\u2665 Access to recent list nd top rado, padcast <br>\u2665 \u23f3SLEEP TIMER (Auto OFF) \u2022 Listen your favorite radio and podcas while you go to bed - without worrying about exhausting your Mobile data \u2022 Set the Sleep timer in the Radio FM app and the app will do the rest for you. It will auto off the Radio at the time you set <br>\u2665 \u23f0ALARM CLOCK (Auto ON) \u2022 Set an Alarm for your favorite Radio \u2022 It will wake you up at alarm time and tunein automatically to Radio, so that you never miss the next News bulletin or the Talk show or Music DJ or RJ Program that you love <br>\u2665 Add Shortcut on your Mobile home screen for fast tunein to your Online Radio Station <br>\u2665 Easy to use and simple radio interface <br>\u2665 Enjoy and download popular podcasts<br>\u2665 Enjoy your favorite Radios and Podcast without headphones. <br>\u2665 Quick swap/ Navigation between Favourite List, Countries List, Recent lists <br>\u2665 Modern design to display the stations listing <br>\u2665 Full Radio player to display title information about currently tuned in station in full screen <br>\u2665 Fast Notification control to stop/start radio stream from home screen <br>\u2665 Fast access to Radio from <br>\u2022 Countries list (Select country and touch the Radio Station) <br>\u2022 Favourite List (Just select the Radio Station) <br>\u2022 Recent List (Just open the recent list and choose the radio station) \u2022<br> Accces podcasts by different Categories <br>\u2022 Shortcut on your Mobile Home screen <br>\u2022 Search the radio and Podcas and select to tunein <br>\u2022 Option to automatically tunein whenever you open the app <br>\u2665 Suggest a Station feature to tunein to your local or any other radio station from any city, state or country <br>\u2665 Radio broadcasters keep adding their Radio Stations to Radio FM platform through http://appradiofm.com/broadcaster/broadcaster-login/ <br>So Tunein new radio channels every time you use our app. <br>\u2022 We already have more than 50,000 Radio Stations worldwide <br>- Radio Sei, 98.1 FM, 104.5 FM, Tele Stereo 92.7 FM, 105 network, RDS from Italy <br>- Virtual DJ, WIXX, ElectricFM, 1.FM Country One, DEFJAY, MOVIN, WOGK, KJLH, WPOZ, KEXP, KCRW from USA <br>- Europe 1 104.7 FM, NRJ, Skyrock 96.0 FM, Fun Radio, RMC, RTL2 from France - BBC, Capital XTRA from UK <br><br>Listen popular pocast like -Global news podcast, ted talks, talk shows, fox news,The Ryen Russillo Podcast,Wild Things, the joe rogan experience and many more.<br><br>\u2022 Still you don&#39;t find what you are searching, use Suggest Feature. Our team will try to add every new broadcasters for you, so you don&#39;t miss your favorite.<br> <br>OUR USERS<br> Radio FM is a trusted Radio App by 75 million user worldwide. We have a promise with our users to provide best playback quality and thrive to make it better everyday. <br><br>Check out the FAQs at http://appRadioFM.com/faq-list/ <br><br>STAY TUNED <br>Facebook: http://fb.com/radiofmapp <br>Instagram: http://instagram.com/radiofmapp <br>Twitter: http://twitter.com/radiofmapp <br>Youtube: www.youtube.com/Radio-fmIn <br><br>Write to us at support@appRadioFM.com <br><br>Keep Listening <br>Radio FM",
